claim.claim-text:
receiving data from a bitstream for a block of pixels to be decoded as a current block of a current picture of a video, the data comprising a secondary transform index that is indicative of a secondary transform applied to the current block;
determining, based on the secondary transform index, whether to perform secondary inverse transform operations on the current block;
selecting, responsive to a positive result in determining whether to perform the secondary inverse transform operations on the current block, a secondary transform mode based on the secondary transform index;
determining, based on the secondary transform index, whether a primary transform index is parsed;
determining, responsive to the positive result in determining whether to perform the secondary inverse transform operations on the current block, that the primary transform index is not parsed;
applying, responsive to the determining that the primary transform index is not parsed, a default primary transform mode to the current block;
decoding the current block by:

